Z||000011||Capt Fiero||08-10-2001||11:26 AM||||I can not speak for rabbits, but a friend of mine has an older VW Scricco with a newer 16V conversion done to it.  The is pretty much gutted so it is light as hell, and he has some sport gears in it.  100mph he is redline in 4th@7000rpms and has to shift to 5th, him and I race in my car if my motor was stock he would take me, but I usually get him by a fender or 2 at best. It is always very close.  <P>------------------<BR>David<BR>85GT<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://photos.onebigvillage.com/pubimage.asp?id_=32415"> ||||reg||1
